    "handle": "native-works-napalm-250",
    "title": "Native Works Napalm 250",
    "descriptionHtml": "<p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">The world famous Napalm diving popper from Native Works but in a <strong>very rare size!</strong><br />Handmade in Japan, very small production.</p><p style=\"text-align: start; ; white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">They are very easy to move, very easy to dive and do a big difference when a pencil can not be used.<br />Intense bubble trail and motion.<br />Swims in any sea conditions.</p><p style=\"text-align: start; ; white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">DONT MISS OUT of these amazing diving poppers! Proven catcher on many fishes all around the globe.<br /><br />100% handmade in Japan by Mr Kawauchi Kenichi, his lures are exceptional and undoubtly unique.</p><ul data-rte-list=\"default\"><li><p style=\"text-align: start; ; white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><span>Length 250 mm</span></p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: start; ; white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><span>Gr. 155</span></p></li></ul>",
